// Supabase project "stacks" (ref: cioepmmgdbyasegnnpjo, us-west-2).
// SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the publishable key — safe to ship client-side.
// Row-level security is the sharing/security mechanism (see
// stacks-context/engineering/platform-and-stack.md); this key grants no
// access on its own. Never put the service_role key in this repo.
//
// The "$()" inside the URL is not a typo: xcconfig treats a bare "//" as a
// comment marker even mid-line, so it must be split to survive parsing.
SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/cioepmmgdbyasegnnpjo.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = sb_publishable_77kQkz4ZV0Fq39vjT8ATUg_KQk0nRhB
